title: "Application of Mathematical Methods to All-Weather Portfolio Optimisation"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Kazakov"
    given-names: "Lev Konstantinovich"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-2203-6245"
    email: "prorab651@gmail.com"

abstract: >-
  Research software for multi-criteria optimisation of the strategic allocation
  of an all-weather portfolio in the Russian financial market.
  Version 2.0.0 uses a buy-and-hold strategy without rebalancing, compares
  several portfolio specifications and includes robustness checks.
  The English title is a translation of the original Russian project title:
  "Использование математических методов для оптимизации всепогодного портфеля".

